<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='14658249690919144268'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICCCAS2027: 2027 16th International Conference on Communications, Circuits, and Systems</div><div id="cfpvenue">Tibet Hotel Chengdu</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Chengdu, China, May 21-24, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.icccas.org/" target="_blank">https://www.icccas.org/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccas2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=icccas2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>January 1, 2027</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=4443" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_green">signal processing</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=51149" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_red bg_bluelight">power management</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=41988307" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_burlywood">advanced integrated circuits</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=29027051" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_violet bg_seagreenlight">sustainable communication networks</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">To further promote academic exchange and technical collaboration in this field, 2027 16th International Conference on Communications, Circuits, and Systems (ICCCAS) will be grandly held in Chengdu, China during May 21-24, 2027! This conference is sponsored by University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China, hosted by School of Information and Communication Engineering (University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China), and have academic support from multiple universities and institutions worldwide.</span></span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">All submitted articles should report original, previously unpublished research results, experimental or theoretical. Articles submitted to the conference should meet these criteria and must not be under consideration for publication elsewhere. We firmly believe that ethical conduct is the most essential virtual of any academic. Hence any act of plagiarism is a totally unacceptable academic misconduct and cannot be tolerated. If an author is found to commit an act of plagiarism, the following acts of sanction will be taken:</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">1. Reject the article submitted or delete the article from the final publications.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">2. Report the authors violation to his/her supervisor(s) and affiliated institution(s)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">3. Report the authors violation to the appropriate overseeing office of academic ethics and research funding agency.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">4. Reserve the right to publish the authors name(s), the title of the article, the name(s) of the affiliated institution and the details of misconduct, etc. of the plagiarist”.</span></span></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 1. Secure and Trustworthy Communications</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 2. AI-Driven Communications &amp; Semantic Networking</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 3. Satellite, Aerial, and Terrestrial Network Integration</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 4. Millimeter-Wave and Terahertz Communication</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 5. Advanced Integrated Circuits for AI and Machine Learning</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 6. Next-Generation Wireless Networks (6G &amp; Beyond)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 7. Green and Sustainable Communication Networks</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 8. Emerging Devices, Photonics &amp; Beyond-CMOS Integration</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 9. RF, Analog, and Mixed-Signal Circuits for Communications</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 10. Signal Processing, Mixed-Signal &amp; Sensor Integration</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 11. Power Management and Energy-Harvesting Circuits</span></span></p><h2>Committees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Advisory Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Franco Maloberti, FIEEE, University of Pavia, Italy</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Division I Director of IEEE; President of the IEEE CAS Society, VP Region 8 of IEEE CAS (1995-1997)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xianbin Wang, FIEEE, Western University, Canada</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Fellow of Canadian Academy of Engineering; Tier-1 Canada Research Chair; Editor-in-Chief, Sensors (Communications Section)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Chengxiang Wang, FIEEE, Southeast University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Fellow of the Royal Society of Edinburgh, IET and China Institute of Communications</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mohamad Sawan, FIEEE, Westlake University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Fellow of the Royal Society of Canada, Canadian Academy of Engineering</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Steering Committee Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mugen Peng, FIEEE, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Vice President of BUPT, Fellow of IET</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Steering Committee</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Lin Wang, SMIEEE, Xiamen University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Wei Zhang, FIEEE, University of New South Wales, Australia</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Vice President of IEEE Communications Society, Fellow of IET</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Haruo Kobayashi, SMIEEE, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Randy Kuang, Quantropi Inc., Ottawa, Canada</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ning Xu, Wuhan University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Honorary Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Seiji Hashimoto, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hao San, Tokyo City University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hiroo Sekiya, Chiba University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Conference Co-Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Massimo Alioto, FIEEE, National University of Singapore, Singapore</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Chair of the Distinguished Lecturer Program for the IEEE CAS Society; Distinguished Lecturer of the IEEE Circuits and Systems Society</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Maode Ma, FIET, Qatar University, Qatar</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Program Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Michel Barbeau, Carleton University, Canada</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Nobuhiko Nakano, Keio University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Kun Qiu, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Program Co-Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Wentao Shi, Northwestern Polytechnical University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Lei Zhang, Tongji University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Haixin Sun, SMIEEE, Xiamen University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jiahua Zhu, SMIEEE, National University of Defense Technology, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Local Organizing Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">You Yin, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Local Organizing Committee</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Kosuke Suzuki, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yuuki Tanaka, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hui Zhang, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Regional Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xingwei Wang, Northeastern University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Choong Yeow Wei, Sea Quantum, Malaysia</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yasushi Yuminaka, SMIEEE, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Publicity Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hiroshi Sakurai, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Feng Wen, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yang Yue, SMIEEE, Xi'an Jiaotong University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Shenhua Yang, Jimei University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Lei Chen, Shandong University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Nives Mikelic Preradovi, University of Zagreb, Croatia</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Biao Wang, Jiangsu University of Science and Technology, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiaoyan Kuai, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Bowen Jia, Wuhan University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Special Session Organizing Chairs</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xueqin Jiang, Donghua University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Haijun Lin, Xiamen University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jie Huang, Southeast University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Chen He, Northwest University, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Publication Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ken Saito, Nihon University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Miaowen Wen, SMIEEE, South China University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Heng Zhou, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jeff Kilby, Auckland University of Technology, New Zealand</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Peiyuan Zhan, Fuzhou University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xin Wu, Xiamen University, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Award Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Kazuyuki Wada, Meiji University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ning Jiang, SMIEEE, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Treasurers</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yuki Furuta, Gunma University, Japan</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Songbo Xie, Wuhan University, China</span></span></p><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">After a careful reviewing process, all accepted papers after proper registration and presentation, will be published in the ICCCAS Conference Proceedings. Conference content will be submitted for inclusion into major database.</span></span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ms. Cynthia Song</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">General Inquiries (Submission, Registration, etc.): </span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">icccas@vip.163.com</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Ms. Tammy Lee</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Technical Program (Tracks, Special Sessions &amp; Invited Speakers): </span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">icccas_contact@vip.163.com</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
